
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d0c16">
  <title>Admin Dashboard | Hysteria's Cure</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/faction-themes.css">

  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --bg: #0d0c16;
      --surface: #151421;
      --surface-2: #1c192b;
      --surface-3: #242037;
      --text: #f5f1ff;
      --muted: #a49db8;
      --accent: #c4a2ff;
      --accent-2: #8f6bd1;
      --border: #302b43;
      --green: #8ce0ad;
      --red: #ff929d;
      --yellow: #ffd479;
      --radius: 17px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 0%, rgba(120, 80, 180, .13), transparent 35%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    button { font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
    [hidden] { display: none !important; }

    .app-shell {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 245px minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    /* SIDEBAR */

    .sidebar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 25px 17px;
      background: rgba(17, 15, 28, .96);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .brand {
      padding: 5px 10px 25px;
      font-size: .95rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1.1px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .brand span { color: var(--accent); }

    .brand small {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .68rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .nav-label {
      margin: 19px 10px 9px;
      color: #777188;
      font-size: .68rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .nav-link {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      padding: 11px 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: .86rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      transition: .18s ease;
    }

    .nav-link:hover,
    .nav-link.active {
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--surface-3);
      border-color: var(--border);
    }

    .nav-link.active {
      box-shadow: inset 3px 0 var(--accent);
    }

    .nav-icon {
      width: 22px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .sidebar-bottom {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 14px 11px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .sidebar-bottom strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    .sidebar-bottom p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .75rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* MAIN AREA */

    .main-area { min-width: 0; }

    .topbar {
      min-height: 72px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      background: rgba(21, 20, 33, .82);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .topbar-title {
      font-size: .9rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .topbar-subtitle {
      margin-top: 3px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .75rem;
    }

    .topbar-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .status-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 8px 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: .76rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--yellow);
    }

    .status-dot.ok { background: var(--green); }
    .status-dot.bad { background: var(--red); }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 39px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--surface-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      transition: .18s ease;
    }

    .button:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

    .button.primary {
      color: #171020;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .button.primary:hover { background: #d3baff; }

    .button:disabled {
      opacity: .55;
      cursor: wait;
    }

    .content {
      width: min(1450px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .welcome {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .7rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: -.8px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.08rem; }
    h3 { margin: 0; font-size: .94rem; }

    p { line-height: 1.6; }

    .muted {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    .welcome p { margin: 7px 0; }

    /* GENERAL PANELS */

    .panel {
      min-width: 0;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding: 21px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(29, 26, 45, .98), rgba(20, 19, 32, .98));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .section-heading {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
    }

    /* STATISTICS */

    .stats-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .stat-card {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    .stat-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .stat-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .77rem;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .stat-icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 33px;
      height: 33px;
      background: var(--surface-3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .stat-value {
      margin: 13px 0 4px;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -.7px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .stat-note {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .7rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* MANAGEMENT */

    .quick-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .quick-card {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 13px;
      transition: transform .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
    }

    .quick-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .quick-icon {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      background: var(--surface-3);
      border-radius: 11px;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .quick-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .quick-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .75rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .quick-arrow {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* AI CONTROL CENTRE */

    .ai-panel {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-color: #55416f;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%, rgba(151, 103, 214, .16), transparent 45%),
        var(--surface);
    }

    .ai-heading {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .ai-title-line {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 7px;
    }

    .ai-title-line h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; }

    .ai-mark {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      color: #1b1425;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e2caff, #a77cdd);
      border-radius: 13px;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      color: var(--yellow);
      border: 1px solid #766039;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: .7rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .notice {
      padding: 13px 15px;
      margin: 17px 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 11px;
      font-size: .8rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .notice.warn {
      color: var(--yellow);
      border-color: #705d36;
      background: rgba(255, 212, 121, .045);
    }

    .notice.error {
      color: var(--red);
      border-color: #78434c;
      background: rgba(255, 146, 157, .045);
    }

    .notice.success {
      color: var(--green);
      border-color: #386b4c;
      background: rgba(140, 224, 173, .045);
    }

    .ai-form {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .ai-field {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 7px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .ai-field.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }

    .ai-field label {
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .ai-field input,
    .ai-field select,
    .ai-field textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      background: #100f19;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 9px;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: .84rem;
    }

    .ai-field textarea {
      min-height: 100px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .ai-field input:focus,
    .ai-field select:focus,
    .ai-field textarea:focus {
      outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .ai-result {
      margin-top: 19px;
      padding: 17px;
      background: #100f19;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .ai-result h3 { color: var(--accent); }

    .ai-result p {
      font-size: .86rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
    }

    .ai-result ul { padding-left: 22px; }
    .ai-result li { margin: 8px 0; line-height: 1.5; }

    .ai-result-section {
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding-top: 13px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .ai-result-section strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .ai-meta {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .75rem;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    /* TWO-COLUMN CONTENT */

    .content-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, .85fr);
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    /* FACTIONS */

    .faction-list { display: grid; gap: 17px; }

    .faction-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(95px, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.5fr) 35px;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      font-size: .78rem;
    }

    .faction-name { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

    .bar {
      height: 9px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #0e0d17;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .bar-fill {
      width: 0;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-2), var(--accent));
      border-radius: inherit;
      transition: width .25s ease;
    }

    .faction-count {
      text-align: right;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* HEALTH */

    .health-list { display: grid; gap: 0; }

    .health-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .health-row:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
    .health-row:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: 0; }

    .health-label {
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .health-description {
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .72rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .health-state {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .health-state.ok { color: var(--green); }
    .health-state.warn { color: var(--yellow); }
    .health-state.bad { color: var(--red); }

    /* TABLE */

    .table-wrap { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: .79rem;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 13px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .7rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    td { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }

    .tag.ok {
      color: var(--green);
      border-color: #386b4c;
    }

    .tag.warn { color: var(--yellow); }

    .empty-state {
      padding: 18px 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: .82rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .monitoring-note {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 14px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .monitoring-note:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

    .monitoring-note strong {
      font-size: .8rem;
    }

    .monitoring-note p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .75rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: .75rem;
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */

    @media (max-width: 1050px) {
      .app-shell { grid-template-columns: 210px minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .content { padding: 23px; }
      .quick-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .app-shell { display: block; }

      .sidebar {
        position: static;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        padding: 12px 15px;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      .brand { padding: 4px 5px 12px; }

      .nav-label,
      .sidebar-bottom { display: none; }

      .nav-list {
        display: flex;
        gap: 7px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        padding-bottom: 3px;
      }

      .nav-link {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        padding: 9px 11px;
        font-size: .75rem;
      }

      .nav-icon { width: auto; }

      .topbar { padding: 13px 18px; }
      .content-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .content { padding: 19px 13px; }
      .topbar { align-items: flex-start; padding: 13px; }
      .topbar-title { font-size: .8rem; }
      .topbar-subtitle { font-size: .68rem; }
      .topbar-actions { gap: 6px; }
      .status-pill { font-size: .68rem; padding: 7px 8px; }
      .topbar-actions .button { padding: 8px 9px; font-size: .72rem; }
      .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 9px; }
      .stat-card { padding: 13px; }
      .stat-value { font-size: 1.55rem; }
      .stat-label { font-size: .7rem; }
      .quick-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .panel { padding: 16px; }
      .ai-form { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .ai-field.full { grid-column: auto; }
      .faction-row { grid-template-columns: 88px minmax(0, 1fr) 27px; gap: 8px; }
      .welcome { align-items: flex-start; }
      .welcome h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; }
      .monitoring-note { flex-direction: column; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="app-shell">

    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="brand">
        HYSTERIA'S <span>CURE</span>
        <small>ADMINISTRATION</small>
      </div>

      <div class="nav-label">Dashboard</div>
      <nav class="nav-list" aria-label="Dashboard navigation">
        <a class="nav-link active" href="#overview">
          <span class="nav-icon">◈</span> Overview
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="#management">
          <span class="nav-icon">▦</span> Management
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="#ai-centre">
          <span class="nav-icon">✧</span> GPT-6 Luna
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="#factions">
          <span class="nav-icon">♜</span> Factions
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="#system-health">
          <span class="nav-icon">◉</span> System Health
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="#recent-activity">
          <span class="nav-icon">≡</span> Recent Questions
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="#learning-activity">
          <span class="nav-icon">⌁</span> Learning Activity
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="nav-label">Platform</div>
      <nav class="nav-list" aria-label="Platform navigation">
        <a class="nav-link" href="student-dashboard.html">
          <span class="nav-icon">⌂</span> Student View
        </a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="pages.html">
          <span class="nav-icon">▤</span> Page Directory
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-bottom">
        <strong>Administrator Access</strong>
        <p>This control centre is restricted to your authorised administrator account.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="main-area">

      <header class="topbar">
        <div>
          <div class="topbar-title">Hysteria's Cure / Control Centre</div>
          <div class="topbar-subtitle">Platform administration</div>
        </div>

        <div class="topbar-actions">
          <span class="status-pill">
            <span id="connection-dot" class="status-dot"></span>
            <span id="connection-label">Checking connection</span>
          </span>
          <button id="logout-button" class="button" type="button">Log out</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main class="content">

        <div id="access-message" class="notice warn" role="status" aria-live="polite">
          Verifying administrator access...
        </div>

        <div id="dashboard" hidden>

          <section class="welcome" id="overview">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">Administrator control centre</div>
              <h1>Dashboard Overview</h1>
              <p class="muted">
                Your platform at a glance. Monitor activity, manage resources,
                and oversee the learning environment.
              </p>
              <p class="muted">
                Last refreshed: <span id="last-refreshed">Waiting for data...</span>
              </p>
            </div>

            <button id="refresh-button" class="button" type="button">
              ↻ Refresh data
            </button>
          </section>

          <div id="dashboard-warning" class="notice warn" hidden></div>

          <!-- PLATFORM STATISTICS -->
          <section aria-labelledby="overview-title">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <h2 id="overview-title">Platform Statistics</h2>
                <p class="muted">Live information from Firebase.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stats-grid">
              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-top">
                  <div class="stat-label">Registered Students</div>
                  <div class="stat-icon">👥</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-users">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note" id="note-users">Waiting for Firebase</div>
              </article>

              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-top">
                  <div class="stat-label">Question Bank</div>
                  <div class="stat-icon">📚</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-questions">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note" id="note-questions">Waiting for Firebase</div>
              </article>

              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-top">
                  <div class="stat-label">Achievements</div>
                  <div class="stat-icon">🏆</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-achievements">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note" id="note-achievements">Waiting for Firebase</div>
              </article>

              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-top">
                  <div class="stat-label">Questions Answered</div>
                  <div class="stat-icon">✍️</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-answered">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note" id="note-answered">Based on saved student progress</div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- MANAGEMENT -->
          <section class="panel" id="management">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <h2>Management Centre</h2>
                <p class="muted">Quick access to your administration tools.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-grid">
              <a class="quick-card" href="admin.html">
                <div class="quick-icon">📝</div>
                <h3>Questions & Achievements</h3>
                <p>Manage question records and achievement definitions.</p>
                <span class="quick-arrow">Open management →</span>
              </a>

              <a class="quick-card" href="admin-materials.html">
                <div class="quick-icon">📚</div>
                <h3>Learning Materials</h3>
                <p>Manage learning materials available to the platform.</p>
                <span class="quick-arrow">Open materials →</span>
              </a>

              <a class="quick-card" href="admin-users.html">
                <div class="quick-icon">👥</div>
                <h3>Student Management</h3>
                <p>Access student and faction management tools.</p>
                <span class="quick-arrow">Manage students →</span>
              </a>

              <a class="quick-card" href="pages.html">
                <div class="quick-icon">🗂️</div>
                <h3>Page Directory</h3>
                <p>Find other pages available in the project.</p>
                <span class="quick-arrow">Browse pages →</span>
              </a>

              <a class="quick-card" href="rewards.html">
                <div class="quick-icon">🏆</div>
                <h3>Rewards Page</h3>
                <p>Inspect the student-facing rewards interface.</p>
                <span class="quick-arrow">Open rewards →</span>
              </a>

              <a class="quick-card" href="question-bank.html">
                <div class="quick-icon">📖</div>
                <h3>Student Question Bank</h3>
                <p>Inspect the question bank from the student side.</p>
                <span class="quick-arrow">Open question bank →</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- GPT-6 LUNA -->
          <section class="panel ai-panel" id="ai-centre" aria-labelledby="ai-title">
            <div class="ai-heading">
              <div>
                <div class="eyebrow">Teacher / Reference Model</div>
                <div class="ai-title-line">
                  <div class="ai-mark">L</div>
                  <h2 id="ai-title">GPT-6 Luna Control Centre</h2>
                </div>
                <p class="muted">
                  Generate original syllabus-aware questions for review.
                  Nothing generated here is published automatically.
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="tag">Human review required</span>
            </div>

            <div class="notice warn">
              GPT-6 Luna is the temporary teacher/reference model for the
              platform. It is not HAI. Its observations are recorded separately
              for later evaluation and curation. Recording an observation does
              not train or update HAI.
            </div>

            <form id="ai-generation-form" class="ai-form">
              <div class="ai-field">
                <label for="ai-subject">Subject</label>
                <input id="ai-subject" name="subject" type="text"
                  maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. Physics" required>
              </div>

              <div class="ai-field">
                <label for="ai-topic">Topic</label>
                <input id="ai-topic" name="topic" type="text"
                  maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Electromagnetic induction" required>
              </div>

              <div class="ai-field">
                <label for="ai-difficulty">Difficulty</label>
                <select id="ai-difficulty" name="difficulty" required>
                  <option value="1">Level 1 — Basic</option>
                  <option value="2">Level 2</option>
                  <option value="3">Level 3</option>
                  <option value="4" selected>Level 4 — Intermediate</option>
                  <option value="5">Level 5</option>
                  <option value="6">Level 6</option>
                  <option value="7">Level 7 — Advanced</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="ai-field">
                <label for="ai-type">Question Format</label>
                <select id="ai-type" name="type" required>
                  <option value="multiple-choice">Multiple Choice</option>
                  <option value="written-response">Written Response</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="ai-field full">
                <label for="ai-instructions">Additional Instructions</label>
                <textarea id="ai-instructions" name="instructions"
                  maxlength="1000"
                  placeholder="Add syllabus requirements, concepts, or other instructions..."></textarea>
              </div>

              <div class="ai-field full">
                <button id="ai-generate-button" class="button primary"
                  type="submit">
                  ✧ Generate Question
                </button>
              </div>
            </form>

            <div id="ai-generation-status" class="notice warn"
              role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>

            <div id="ai-generation-result" class="ai-result" hidden>
              <h3>Generated Question</h3>
              <div id="ai-result-content"></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- FACTIONS AND HEALTH -->
          <div class="content-grid">

            <section class="panel" id="factions">
              <div class="section-heading">
                <div>
                  <h2>Faction Overview</h2>
                  <p class="muted">Student distribution across the factions.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div id="faction-list" class="faction-list">
                <div class="empty-state">Waiting for student data...</div>
              </div>
              <p id="faction-note" class="muted"></p>
            </section>

            <section class="panel" id="system-health">
              <div class="section-heading">
                <div>
                  <h2>System Health</h2>
                  <p class="muted">Basic connectivity and data checks.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="health-list">
                <div class="health-row">
                  <div>
                    <div class="health-label">Administrator Authentication</div>
                    <div class="health-description">Administrator UID verification.</div>
                  </div>
                  <span id="health-auth" class="health-state warn">Checking</span>
                </div>

                <div class="health-row">
                  <div>
                    <div class="health-label">Firebase Database</div>
                    <div class="health-description">Database read connectivity.</div>
                  </div>
                  <span id="health-database" class="health-state warn">Checking</span>
                </div>

                <div class="health-row">
                  <div>
                    <div class="health-label">Student Profiles</div>
                    <div class="health-description">Access to saved user profiles.</div>
                  </div>
                  <span id="health-profiles" class="health-state warn">Checking</span>
                </div>

                <div class="health-row">
                  <div>
                    <div class="health-label">Question Bank</div>
                    <div class="health-description">Access to question records.</div>
                  </div>
                  <span id="health-questions" class="health-state warn">Checking</span>
                </div>

                <div class="health-row">
                  <div>
                    <div class="health-label">Achievement Data</div>
                    <div class="health-description">Access to rewardSystem/achievements.</div>
                  </div>
                  <span id="health-achievements" class="health-state warn">Checking</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <p class="muted">
                Successful reads do not prove that all writes, security rules,
                or student-facing features work correctly.
              </p>
            </section>

          </div>

          <!-- RECENT QUESTIONS -->
          <section class="panel" id="recent-activity">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <h2>Recently Added Questions</h2>
                <p class="muted">Latest records based on saved creation timestamps.</p>
              </div>
              <a href="admin.html" class="button">Manage Questions →</a>
            </div>

            <div class="table-wrap">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Question ID</th>
                    <th>Subject</th>
                    <th>Topic</th>
                    <th>Level</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="recent-questions">
                  <tr>
                    <td colspan="5" class="empty-state">
                      Waiting for question data...
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </section>

          <!-- LEARNING ACTIVITY -->
          <section class="panel" id="learning-activity">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <h2>Learning Activity</h2>
                <p class="muted">Combined totals from saved student progress.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stats-grid" style="margin-bottom:0;">
              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Correct Answers</div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-correct">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note">Combined saved progress</div>
              </article>

              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Lifetime XP</div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-xp">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note">Combined saved XP</div>
              </article>

              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Points</div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-points">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note">Current saved balances</div>
              </article>

              <article class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-label">Completed Sessions</div>
                <div class="stat-value" id="stat-sessions">—</div>
                <div class="stat-note">Combined saved sessions</div>
              </article>
            </div>

            <p class="muted">
              These are database totals, not monthly totals. Monthly earning
              limits and rank calculations are not enforced by this dashboard.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- MONITORING NOTES -->
          <section class="panel">
            <div class="section-heading">
              <div>
                <h2>Monitoring Notes</h2>
                <p class="muted">Features requiring separate implementation or testing.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="monitoring-note">
              <div>
                <strong>Administrative Activity Log</strong>
                <p>A reliable audit log has not yet been connected to this dashboard.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="health-state warn">Not configured</span>
            </div>

            <div class="monitoring-note">
              <div>
                <strong>Monthly Rewards</strong>
                <p>Monthly point allowances and earnings require their own implementation and validation.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="health-state warn">Needs testing</span>
            </div>

            <div class="monitoring-note">
              <div>
                <strong>Achievement Payouts</strong>
                <p>Achievement definitions alone do not implement secure unlocking or bonus payouts.</p>
              </div>
              <span class="health-state warn">Needs integration</span>
            </div>
          </section>

        </div>
      </main>

      <footer>
        Hysteria's Cure · Administration
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Only one dashboard controller: do not add the old inline script back. -->
  <script type="module" src="./js/admin.js"></script>
  <script type="module" src="./js/faction-theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
